{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">上海市昨日下暴雨，楊浦區、虹口區出現大範圍水浸。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.SH.RAIN-1130.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026NkGwWYphbl1784522994.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.SH.RAIN-1130.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網上片段見到，楊浦區一間地勢較低的超市嚴重水浸。大雨形成的積水，沿樓梯和扶手電梯湧入超市內。街道積水深至行人小腿，街道變成河流。汽車要涉水而行，有汽車拋錨。有人出動橡皮艇，營救被困司機。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.SH.RAIN-1130_002.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026c0BSnNycM31784523008.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.SH.RAIN-1130_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">昨日中午後，上海雨勢不斷，楊浦區、虹口區更出現特大暴雨。當局出動超過七萬人救災，到深夜大部分積水逐漸消退。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-20T05:19:22.320852+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":172,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}